<title>UK: Russian Nizhny Novgorod hopes for Eurobond by June.</title>
<headline>Russian Nizhny Novgorod hopes for Eurobond by June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The governor of Nizhny Novgorod said on Thursday he hoped the Russian region's first Eurobond would be issued by June for $75-100 million.</p>
<p>The money will be used to improve local water supplies, Boris Nemtsov told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope it will happen in May or June...it depends on the market,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
